            <ArticleTitle>[Lumbosacral spinal epidural cysts. Considerations on a clinical case].</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>300-5</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>A case of extradural lumbosacral cyst, secondary to an operation of discal exeresis, is described. Current literature regarding this type of lesion is reviewed and genetic and clinical features are discussed.</AbstractText>
